actor "Signed-in User" as U
participant "SSFM Interface" as UI
participant "AuthController" as C
participant "AuthService" as S
participant "PrismaService" as P
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
caption Existing + proposed extension - target design, not a claim of complete implementation
U -> UI : 1. Sign out
activate UI
UI -> C : 2. Sign out
activate C
' ref-target: SIGNOUT-CHECKS
ref over C : 3. Validate request\n(SIGNOUT-CHECKS)
alt 3.1 Invalid request
C -->> UI : 3.1.1. Request rejected
else else
