activate P
P -> DB : 4.1.2. Revoke refresh session
activate DB
DB -->> P : 4.1.3. Refresh session ended
deactivate DB
P -->> S : 4.1.4. Refresh session ended
deactivate P
end
note over S
Proposed extension: Complete session invalidation.
end note
S -> P : 5. Invalidate remaining access to the ended session
activate P
P -> DB : 6. Invalidate remaining access to the ended session
activate DB
DB -->> P : 7. Session no longer usable
deactivate DB
P -->> S : 8. Session no longer usable
deactivate P
S -->> C : 9. Sign-out result
deactivate S
C -->> UI : 10. Return result or error
end
deactivate C
UI -->> U : 11. Clear local sign-in state and show sign-in screen
deactivate UI
